---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Data policy | CRISPR Screen Explorer"
  description="Which data this site hosts, under which licences, and how to report a problem."
>
  <h1>Data policy</h1>
  <p class="notice">
    No datasets are published yet. This page describes the rules that will apply when they are.
  </p>
  <h2>Sources and licences</h2>
  <p>
    Only data that may legally be redistributed is hosted. Each dataset page shows the source,
    version, licence and the attribution text the licence requires. The first planned source,
    BioGRID ORCS, is distributed under the MIT licence, which requires keeping its copyright
    and licence notice.
  </p>
  <h2>Standardization</h2>
  <p>
    Source data is converted to one common format. Original values are kept, and every
    transformation is documented. Where a value cannot be mapped reliably it is marked as
    unmapped rather than guessed.
  </p>
  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>This site does not use accounts or cookies and does not collect personal data.</p>
  <h2>Corrections and takedown</h2>
  <p>Contact details for corrections and takedown requests will be published before launch.</p>
</Base>
